<title>UK: South Korea enters market to buy raw sugar - Licht.</title>
<headline>South Korea enters market to buy raw sugar - Licht.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea is in the market to buy 14,000 tonnes of raw sugar, German statistician F.O. Licht said on Friday.</p>
<p>In its daily report, Licht said May/June was the requested shipment period.</p>
<p>Further details have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
